Portions of the following modules are derived from career-ops and were
translated from JavaScript to TypeScript for this project:

  src/server/verification/ats-score.ts
      Derived from career-ops `verify-ats.mjs`: the eight weighted ATS
      parseability dimensions, their weights, and the pass threshold.

  src/server/verification/fact-gate.ts
      Derived from career-ops `verify-cv-facts.mjs`: numeric and metric claim
      extraction, claim normalization, and the forbidden-phrase list.

  evals/
      The golden-set evaluation design — labelled cases, a zero-cost replay
      mode, and agreement-against-reference gates — follows career-ops
      `eval-golden.mjs`.

  src/server/ingest/{greenhouse,ashby,lever}.ts
      Request shapes, host allowlists and SSRF guards follow the career-ops
      `providers/` clients.

  src/server/llm/score-job.ts
      The scoring rubric bands and hard-disqualifier approach follow the
      career-ops evaluation playbooks in `modes/`.


